  "label": "The Matrix (1999 film)",
  "description": "The meme references the iconic scene from 'The Matrix' where the character Neo (played by Keanu Reeves) says 'I'm from the group' while holding a briefcase and raising his hands in surrender. This scene is widely recognized and used in internet culture to imply someone is part of a group or organization, often used humorously or ironically. The visual of the man in the suit is directly modeled after Neo's appearance in that scene.",
